sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Institution Admin
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Engine as PDF & Hash Engine
    participant DB as Relational Database
    participant Contract as Smart Contract (Solidity)
    participant Chain as Hardhat EVM

    Admin->>UI: Fill Student Degree Details & Click Issue
    UI->>API: POST /api/certificates (JWT Bearer)
    API->>API: Verify Issuer Wallet Authorization
    API->>Engine: Generate Certificate PDF (ReportLab + QR Code)
    Engine->>Engine: Calculate SHA-256 Digest (bytes32)
    Engine->>API: Return PDF Bytes & 0x-Hash
    API->>Contract: issueCertificate(certId, certHash)
    Contract->>Contract: Verify Caller == authorizedIssuer
    Contract->>Contract: Verify certId does not exist
    Contract->>Chain: Store {certHash, issuer, block.timestamp, revoked: false}
    Chain-->>Contract: Emit CertificateIssued
    Contract-->>API: Transaction Receipt (txHash, blockNumber)
    API->>DB: Save off-chain metadata & tx record
    API-->>UI: Return Certificate Response (ID, txHash, Hash)
    UI-->>Admin: Display Success Badge & Download Link
